add_before('\\subsection{Within-task availability',r'''The eight sets contain eight positions each but only 56 distinct profiles overall. Table~\ref{tab:sets} describes their composition. The reconstruction checks eight distinct assigned identifiers per valid sequence and no duplicate profile within a teacher. Responses outside that sequence are omitted. Harshness references pool matching six-attribute profiles across sets and exclude the focal teacher. Table~\ref{tab:reconstruction} compares reconstruction B with removal of shared fields, no outcome-based screen, complete eight-response records and identifier-specific references.''')
